method.description:
Registers a simple resource format with one call: resources saved to a path ending with [param extension] are written by calling [param save], without writing a [ResourceFormatSaver]. Use [method ResourceLoader.register_extension] to load files of the same format.
[param extension] is given without the leading dot and is compared case-insensitively; it may contain dots, for example [code]"quiz.json"[/code]. [param save] receives the resource and the path ([code]func(resource: Resource, path: String)[/code]) and returns an [enum Error] code; a function without a return value counts as [constant OK].
[param type] is the class of the resources this format saves: a [Resource] class or a global script class ([code]class_name[/code]) that extends [Resource]. Only resources of that class or of a class that inherits it are saved with this format. If [param at_front] is [code]true[/code], the format is asked before all other registered savers.
Registering an extension again replaces the previous [Callable]. Returns [constant OK], or [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if the extension, the callable or the type is not valid.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
func _ready():
	ResourceSaver.register_extension("quiz", _save_quiz, &"QuizSet")
	ResourceSaver.save(my_quiz, "user://questions.quiz")

static func _save_quiz(quiz: QuizSet, path: String) -> Error:
	var file := FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.WRITE)
	if file == null:
		return FileAccess.get_open_error()
	file.store_string("\n".join(quiz.questions))
	return OK
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
public override void _Ready()
{
	ResourceSaver.RegisterExtension("quiz", Callable.From<Resource, string, int>(SaveQuiz), "QuizSet");
	ResourceSaver.Save(_myQuiz, "user://questions.quiz");
}

private static int SaveQuiz(Resource resource, string path)
{
	using var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);
	if (file == null)
	{
		return (int)FileAccess.GetOpenError();
	}
	file.StoreString(string.Join('\n', ((QuizSet)resource).Questions));
	return (int)Error.Ok;
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
[b]Note:[/b] [param save] is called on the thread that calls [method save], with no engine lock held. If the object that [param save] is bound to is freed, saving fails with an error. All registrations are removed when the engine shuts down.
